<title>USA: Louisiana Land rallies after discovery.</title>
<headline>Louisiana Land rallies after discovery.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Louisiana Land &amp; Exploration rallied 2-1/8 to 54-5/8 after the company announced it had discovered a well on its Madden Field in Wyoming which could have reserves of three trillion cubic feet of natural gas.</p>
<p>The company drilled a step out well which tested at 44 million cubic feet of natural gas per day.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
